---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import DecisionGraphic from "../components/DecisionGraphic.astro";
import "../styles/home.css";
import { site } from "../lib/site";
---

<BaseLayout home>
  <div class="site-shell editorial-home">
    <section class="home-intro" aria-labelledby="home-title">
      <div class="home-intro__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Marketing measurement &amp; analytics engineering</p>
        <h1 id="home-title">
          I build the measurement teams use to decide where marketing budget
          goes.
        </h1>
        <p class="home-intro__dek">
          Attribution, marketing mix models, experiments and forecasts, built
          on governed dbt and Snowflake models.
        </p>
        <div class="home-intro__actions">
          <a class="button-primary" href="#selected-work">View my work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href={site.resume} download>Résumé <span class="link-detail">PDF · one page</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="home-portrait">
        <img
          src="/images/derek-shirley-photo.jpg"
          alt="Derek Shirley"
          width="800"
          height="800"
          fetchpriority="high"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <figcaption>
          <span>Based in Dallas-Fort Worth</span>
          <span>Open to remote, hybrid and contract roles</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="home-strengths" aria-labelledby="strengths-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2 class="eyebrow" id="strengths-title">What I bring</h2>
      </div>
      <dl class="leadership-evidence leadership-evidence--columns">
        <div>
          <dt>Marketing measurement</dt>
          <dd>
            Multi-touch attribution, marketing mix modeling in Google Meridian,
            holdout and A/B test design, and partner enrollment forecasting.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Analytics engineering</dt>
          <dd>
            Governed dbt models on Snowflake and Databricks, metric
            definitions, and a semantic layer designed on dbt MetricFlow and
            Lightdash.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>AI-assisted delivery</dt>
          <dd>
            Cursor and Claude agents with root-level safety hooks, used only in
            dev environments and never on production data, for about 2.6x more
            throughput.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="selected-stories" id="selected-work" aria-labelledby="selected-work-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2 class="eyebrow" id="selected-work-title">Selected work</h2>
      </div>

      <article class="lead-story">
        <div class="lead-story__copy">
          <p class="story-context">Lark Health <span>November 2025 to November 2026</span></p>
          <h3><a href="/experience#lark-health">Marketing attribution and measurement</a></h3>
          <p>
            Led marketing analytics, attribution and measurement for partner
            programs and direct-to-consumer growth at an AI health coaching
            company.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link arrow-link" href="/experience#lark-health">Read the Lark Health summary <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <ul class="story-points">
          <li>Rebuilt marketing attribution across web, paid media, direct mail, partner and enrollment channels in governed Snowflake/dbt models.</li>
          <li>Built the measurement layer for the Samsung Health partnership launch, from metric definitions and first- and last-touch attribution to launch-day reporting.</li>
          <li>Built 12-month partner enrollment forecasts that guided send volumes and direct-mail budgets, and designed a randomized direct-mail holdout test.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <div class="supporting-stories">
        <article class="supporting-story">
          <div class="supporting-story__copy">
            <p class="story-context">Dave &amp; Buster’s <span>Marketing planning and web analysis</span></p>
            <h3><a href="/work/dnb-marketing-ecosystem">A $6.9M Q4 budget recommendation</a></h3>
            <p>
              On a three-hour deadline, I built the media-contribution model
              used to recommend a $6.9M Q4 budget to the CEO and CMO.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link arrow-link" href="/work/dnb-marketing-ecosystem">Read the case study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
          <DecisionGraphic />
        </article>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link arrow-link all-work-link" href="/work">All work &amp; research <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <article class="home-research-project">
        <div>
          <p class="story-context">Independent research <span>In development</span></p>
          <h3><a href="/work/airport-weather">When does weather disrupt an airport?</a></h3>
          <p>A working airport weather explorer, with a study of how much warning forecasts give us about delays and cancellations.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="text-link arrow-link" href="/work/airport-weather">Explore the project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="home-leadership" aria-labelledby="leadership-title">
      <div class="home-leadership__intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Management experience</p>
        <h2 id="leadership-title">Managing teams and mentoring analysts</h2>
        <p>
          I’ve managed a sales team, built a pricing analytics department, and
          set team standards for analysts.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link arrow-link" href="/experience">Full experience <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <dl class="leadership-evidence">
        <div>
          <dt>Establishing pricing analytics</dt>
          <dd>
            At American Diamond Logistics, I built the department and its data
            stack, selected and trained an internal analyst, and coached
            logistics coordinators. The pricing workflow improved response
            time by about 43% and win rate by about 22%.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Setting team standards</dt>
          <dd>
            At Lark Health, I led 8 analytics initiatives, set up the new
            team’s documentation and peer-review process within 48 hours, and
            coached other analysts.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Leading commercial teams</dt>
          <dd>
            At Park West, I managed up to five salespeople and coordinated
            staff from other departments for art movement and auction setup.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="home-contact" aria-labelledby="home-contact-title">
      <div>
        <h2 id="home-contact-title">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Open to staff, lead and senior IC roles and analytics leadership in
          marketing measurement, growth analytics and analytics engineering.
          Full-time remote, or hybrid in Dallas-Fort Worth, and open to
          relocating. Available now for contract work too.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="home-contact__actions">
        <a class="button-primary" href={"mailto:" + site.email}>Email me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href={site.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Connect on LinkedIn<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
